    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406-a1-a20">

                <pb facs="0660" n="590" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg590"/>

                <head>[Enclosure No. 34. ]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State, for War and
                                Marine,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San Luis Potosi,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 16, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The application presented by you of this day’s date to the President of the
                    republic, soliciting the favor of pardon to be granted to Ferdinand Maximilian
                    of Hapsburg, who has been sentenced at Queretaro by the council of war which
                    tried him to suffer the extreme penalty has been met by the following
                    decision:</p>
                <p>“This application for pardon, and others presented with the like object, having
                    been examined with all the deliberation which the gravity of the case requires,
                    the President of the republic has been pleased to determine that he cannot
                    accede to them, because the weightiest reasons of justice, and the necessity of
                    assuring the peace of the nation, are opposed thereto.”</p>
                <p>I communicate this for your information, and as the result of the application
                    referred to.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MEJIA.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mariano Riva Palacio</hi> and</p>
                    <p>Lic. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rafael Martinez de la Torre,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Present.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
